00:09:16.678 --> 00:09:21.079
There's no black neighborhood,
You know what I'm sayin'?

00:09:21.079 --> 00:09:23.634
Where black people have the
same amount of money as me.

00:09:23.634 --> 00:09:26.188
You know what I'm sayin'? There's
richer and there's poorer.

00:09:26.188 --> 00:09:28.341
There's no, just, you know,
did a movie got a little

00:09:28.341 --> 00:09:30.889
bit of money, livin'
okay, black neighborhood.

00:09:30.889 --> 00:09:32.166
I have to be in a white neighborhood.

00:09:32.166 --> 00:09:34.595
So I don't fit in. That's
hell. It's hell when you can't

00:09:34.595 --> 00:09:36.424
