00:09:56.335 --> 00:09:58.927
If you grew up happy, too
happy. You know like in

00:09:58.927 --> 00:10:01.925
fairy tale land. Not
fairy tale, if you grew up

00:10:01.925 --> 00:10:04.173
where every Christmas you got a present

00:10:04.173 --> 00:10:07.655
